{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2112749, "id": "zh-01", "transcript": "大家好，今天我们讨论新版本的发布计划。", "translation": "Hello everyone, today we are discussing the release plan for the new version.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2335.15530009754}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-02", "transcript": "这次我们会先做灰度发布，覆盖百分之五的用户。", "translation": "We will first do a canary release, covering 5% of users.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1833.710600156337}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-03", "transcript": "如果错误率超过千分之一，就立即回滚。", "translation": "If the error rate exceeds one per thousand, roll back immediately.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1822.694200091064}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-04", "transcript": "大模型的推理成本比上个季度下降了一半。", "translation": "The inference cost of the LLM has decreased by half compared to last quarter.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2886.3995999563485}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-05", "transcript": "它的响应速度也提升了不少。", "translation": "Its response speed has also improved a lot.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1694.4126000162214}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-06", "transcript": "请问去火车站怎么走？", "translation": "How do I get to the train station?", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1805.026999907568}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-07", "transcript": "沿着这条路一直走，到第二个路口右转。", "translation": "Walk straight along this road and turn right at the second intersection.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1852.3413999937475}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-08", "transcript": "大概要走十分钟左右。", "translation": "It should take about ten minutes.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1699.8332999646664}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-09", "transcript": "附近有没有便宜一点的酒店？", "translation": "Is there a cheaper hotel nearby?", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1767.2706001903862}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "zh-10", "transcript": "我想订两晚，明天入住。", "translation": "I want to book two nights, check in tomorrow.", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1650.7413000799716}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-01", "transcript": "Thanks for calling, how can I help you today?", "translation": "谢谢您来电，今天我能为您做些什么？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1714.5360000431538}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-02", "transcript": "My order arrived yesterday, but the screen is cracked.", "translation": "我的订单昨天到了，但屏幕裂了。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1869.9546998832375}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-03", "transcript": "I'm sorry about that. Could you send us a photo of it?", "translation": "很抱歉。你能给我们发一张它的照片吗？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1736.263700062409}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-04", "transcript": "We will ship a replacement within two business days.", "translation": "我们将在两个工作日内发出换货。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1692.5757999997586}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-05", "transcript": "You don't need to return the damaged one.", "translation": "你不需要返回损坏的那个。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2147.4025000352412}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-06", "transcript": "Let's move on to the quarterly revenue report.", "translation": "让我们继续来看季度收入报告。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1778.051899978891}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-07", "transcript": "Revenue grew twelve percent year over year.", "translation": "收入同比增长了12%。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2420.719699934125}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-08", "transcript": "Most of the growth came from the Asian market.", "translation": "大部分增长来自亚洲市场。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1826.3043998740613}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-09", "transcript": "We plan to open two new offices there next year.", "translation": "我们计划明年在那里开设两家新办事处。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1881.4515999983996}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "en-10", "transcript": "Any questions before we wrap up?", "translation": "结束前还有问题吗？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1690.6056001316756}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-01", "transcript": "すみません、この近くに駅はありますか。", "translation": "不好意思，请问附近有车站吗。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2704.840100137517}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-02", "transcript": "まっすぐ行って、二つ目の信号を左に曲がってください。", "translation": "直进して、二つ目の信号を左に曲がってください。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1808.4265999495983}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-03", "transcript": "歩いて五分ぐらいです。", "translation": "步行大约五分钟。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1795.2820002101362}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-04", "transcript": "切符はどこで買えますか。", "translation": "车票在哪里可以买到？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1726.380200125277}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-05", "transcript": "改札の横に券売機があります。", "translation": "检票口旁边有售票机。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1770.4627998173237}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-06", "transcript": "今日の会議では新しい機能について話します。", "translation": "今天的会议将讨论新功能。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1697.3479001317173}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-07", "transcript": "来月から大規模言語モデルを導入する予定です。", "translation": "从下个月开始计划引入大模型。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1743.7195999082178}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-08", "transcript": "まずは社内の問い合わせ対応で試します。", "translation": "首先在公司内部的咨询应对中进行尝试。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1785.5521000456065}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-09", "transcript": "効果が良ければ、お客様向けにも展開します。", "translation": "如果效果良好，也将向客户推出。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1700.593600049615}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2128398, "id": "ja-10", "transcript": "何か質問があれば、遠慮なく聞いてください。", "translation": "何か質問があれば、遠慮なく聞いてください。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2124.602399999276}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-01", "transcript": "안녕하세요, 예약을 확인하고 싶어요.", "translation": "您好，我想确认预订。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1869.2731999326497}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-02", "transcript": "성함이 어떻게 되세요?", "translation": "您叫什么名字？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1706.2519998289645}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-03", "transcript": "김민수입니다. 이틀 묵을 예정이에요.", "translation": "金敏秀。计划住两晚。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1811.1191000789404}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-04", "transcript": "아침 식사는 몇 시부터인가요?", "translation": "早餐从几点开始？", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 2772.296599810943}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-05", "transcript": "일곱 시부터 열 시까지 일 층 식당에서 드실 수 있습니다.", "translation": "从七点到十点，您可以在一楼餐厅用餐。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1710.7144000474364}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-06", "transcript": "이번 분기 매출이 목표를 넘었습니다.", "translation": "本次季度销售额超过了目标。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1656.8356999196112}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-07", "transcript": "특히 온라인 판매가 크게 늘었습니다.", "translation": "特别是在线销售大幅增加。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1852.0800999831408}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-08", "transcript": "다음 달에는 신제품을 출시할 계획입니다.", "translation": "下个月计划推出新产品。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1742.2770999837667}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-09", "transcript": "마케팅 예산도 조금 늘릴 예정입니다.", "translation": "营销预算也将略有增加。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1731.1426000669599}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
{"group": "text_upper", "ts": 1791114977.2138503, "id": "ko-10", "transcript": "오늘 회의는 여기서 마치겠습니다.", "translation": "今天会议到此结束。", "metrics": [{"e2eMs": 1604.9232999794185}], "errors": [], "utterances": 1}
